This is a '''list of political parties in [[Okaiken]]''', including both active and defunct organizations. Okaiken has a [[multi-party system]] with two dominant parties—the [[Progressive Party of Okaiken|Progressive Party]] (PPO) and the [[Liberal Democratic Party (Okaiken)|Liberal Democratic Party]] (LDP)—and several smaller parties that hold representation in the [[National Diet of Okaiken|National Diet]].

The current governing coalition consists of the Progressive Party and the [[Okaiken Socialist Party]], led by Prime Minister [[Honda Shigetsuma]].

