===Government and opposition===

The current government is formed by a coalition between the Progressive Party (PPO) and the Okaiken Socialist Party (OSP), with [[Honda Shigetsuma]] (PPO) serving as Prime Minister. The coalition holds 231 seats in the House of Commoners, short of the 238 needed for a majority, requiring ongoing negotiations with opposition parties on key legislation.

The opposition is led by the Liberal Democratic Party (LDP) under [[Koichiro Sadanuma]], which regained significant ground in the 2025 election with a gain of 40 seats. The LDP opposition bloc (including informal allies) controls approximately 223 seats.

